<title>SINGAPORE: L&amp;M Group requests trading suspension.</title>
<headline>L&amp;M Group requests trading suspension.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1997-04-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Construction firm L&amp;M Group Investments Ltd said on Monday it had asked the Stock Exchange of Singapore to suspend trading of its shares and warrants.</p>
<p>In a statement it said this should take place with immediate effect and until further notice, pending an announcement.</p>
<p>The statement gave no further notice.</p>
<p>--Singapore newsroom (65 8703080)</p>
</text>
